# a beat on track 1: the kick on 1 5 9 13, the snare on 5 and 13, hats on every other step
wait 200
expect page Steps
tapkey w0
tapkey w4
tapkey w8
tapkey w12
wait 40
shot beat_kick.png
tapkey b1
tapkey w4
tapkey w12
tapkey b2
tapkey w0
tapkey w2
tapkey w4
tapkey w6
tapkey w8
tapkey w10
tapkey w12
tapkey w14
wait 40
shot beat_hats.png
steps 1 1
tap PLAY
expect playing 1
wait 1200
shot beat_playing.png
leds
# a trick on step 7: hold the step, ARP, KNOB 1 to multiply (the third), KNOB 2 its value (3 hits)
key w6 down
wait 100
shot step_held.png
key w6 up
key w6 down
wait 60
tap ARP
turn K1 3
turn K2 1
wait 40
shot step_component.png
leds
key w6 up
expect comp 1 7 3
# a second trick, skip trigger (the fourteenth) on KNOB 3, its cycle and mode on KNOB 4, then off again
key w6 down
wait 60
tap ARP
turn K3 14
turn K4 12
wait 40
shot step_two_comps.png
turn K3 -14
key w6 up
# a step held + a black key: that sound on the step
key w2 down
wait 60
tapkey b0
key w2 up
expect note 1 1 3 1
# (a kit step's first is its lowest sound: the kick beside the hat)
wait 1500
tap PLAY
expect playing 0
